<title>GERMANY: BOE's George-political will for EMU very strong.</title>
<headline>BOE's George-political will for EMU very strong.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of England governor Eddie George said on Tuesday that in his view, political forces across Europe remained committed to European monetary union.</p>
<p>&quot;The political determination is very strong,&quot; George told reproters after the monthly meeting of European central bankers at the European Monetary Institute.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 6 9756525</p>
</text>
